        "is_free": false,
        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4101990/extras/263e137ce7fd18a9781e64ecf90f45ad.webp?t=1763701461\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4101990/extras/263e137ce7fd18a9781e64ecf90f45ad.poster.avif?t=1763701461\" class=\"bb_img\" width=64 height=64 /></picture></span>                                    <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4101990/extras/f6f2fb22350d048dfe6e72e48af31972.webp?t=1763701461\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4101990/extras/f6f2fb22350d048dfe6e72e48af31972.poster.avif?t=1763701461\" class=\"bb_img\" width=64 height=64 /></picture></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Harsh Reality of Being a Hamster</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Give your tiny friend a name and welcome them to your desktop! In this cozy yet slightly tragic idle pet simulator, you’ll care for your hamster by feeding it, giving it water, and showering it with affection. Keep your furry companion happy and healthy — or face the heartbreaking consequences of neglect.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Appreciate the simple joy (and responsibility) of having a living, breathing buddy right beside your workspace. Cute, calming, and just a little too real.</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4101990/extras/263e137ce7fd18a9781e64ecf90f45ad.webp?t=1763701461\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4101990/extras/263e137ce7fd18a9781e64ecf90f45ad.poster.avif?t=1763701461\" class=\"bb_img\" width=64 height=64 /></picture></span>                                    <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4101990/extras/f6f2fb22350d048dfe6e72e48af31972.webp?t=1763701461\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4101990/extras/f6f2fb22350d048dfe6e72e48af31972.poster.avif?t=1763701461\" class=\"bb_img\" width=64 height=64 /></picture></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Harsh Reality of Being a Hamster</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Give your tiny friend a name and welcome them to your desktop! In this cozy yet slightly tragic idle pet simulator, you’ll care for your hamster by feeding it, giving it water, and showering it with affection. Keep your furry companion happy and healthy — or face the heartbreaking consequences of neglect.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Appreciate the simple joy (and responsibility) of having a living, breathing buddy right beside your workspace. Cute, calming, and just a little too real.</p>",
        "short_description": "Take care of your small, fluffy companion in this cute, charming idle pet simulator. Watch your little hamster sleep, eat, and explore right on your desktop — but don’t forget to keep it fed and happy if you want it to survive.",
